  "details": "right now we can chose between shown, icon only or hidden:\n\n-shown is too much, it's like a whole billboard of mostly useless visual clutter, it almost completely covers the top half of my visual field in crowded instances.\n\n-hidden is confusing because some people change avis all the time.\n\n-icon only is mostly useless because most people either don't set one or change it all the time so it's not a reliable identifier.\n\ni want the option to just display the username, and nothing else.\n\nthis is as much needed as an accessibility feature as it is simply a practical way to keep our visual field clean and readable in VR.\n\ni know this request has been denied already 6 years ago but without providing clear a clear reason for it.  \n\nbut the landscape is changing and it feels like it need to be adressed again as the UI is being reworked again.",
